  "ingredients": [
    "2 large skinless, boneless chicken breast halves",
    "salt and black pepper to taste",
    "8 asparagus spears, trimmed - divided",
    "0.5 cup shredded mozzarella cheese, divided",
    "1 to 2 tablespoons mayonnaise",
    "0.25 cup Italian seasoned bread crumbs"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease an 8-inch square baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ck7Lrs5MU6anXyoWWBG5BR8p6pg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/2213647-asparagus-mozzarella-stuffed-chicken-breasts-DDMFS-step-01-34bad072a686476f86f3764f007d53e5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213647/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place each chicken breast between two sheets of heavy plastic (resealable freezer bags work well) on a solid, level surface. Firmly pound chicken with the smooth side of a meat mallet to an even thickness of about 1/4 inch. Sprinkle each side with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/a-5YUMn-PRqx9W_qxkR0d7LwIhU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/2213647-asparagus-mozzarella-stuffed-chicken-breasts-DDMFS-step-02-8f1817b1c290484baf183e4a801bef0f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213647/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place four asparagus spears down the center of each chicken breast, then top with mozzarella. Roll chicken around fillings to make tidy, compact rolls.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4rMp2OtD-cXp8z-4BWjt0Z9YkL0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/2213647-asparagus-mozzarella-stuffed-chicken-breasts-DDMFS-step-03-567387f8042f4535b66ed9197565bc2c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213647/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer chicken, seam-side down, to the prepared baking dish. Brush chicken breasts with mayonnaise if using and sprinkle bread crumbs over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J1gNzLXT-Cop-5WzPTOmsyf5wqE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/2213647-asparagus-mozzarella-stuffed-chicken-breasts-DDMFS-step-04-3a9b64ba456943a5844662c913909989.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213647/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, about 25 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mIoiNp6bX4Hlsw6cHgQx4dOayMI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/2213647-asparagus-mozzarella-stuffed-chicken-breasts-DDMFS-step-05-7b7bb9ea986e4d2d8be7537720aa9ef7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/213647/step_05.webp"
    }
